BOSS Colossus Phase 2A Boulders Q
    Events
        Time - Every 30.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        BossColossusGolems Equal to False
        (BossColossus is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Unit - Add Boulders (Colossus) to BossColossus
        Set VariableSet BossColossusBoulders = True
        Sound - Play Colossus03 <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Wait 0.50 seconds
        -------- Get BossColossus location and facing angle --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossusTempPoint = (Position of BossColossus)
        Set VariableSet BossColossusFacingAngle = (Facing of BossColossus)
        -------- Calculate the location 300 units in front of BossColossus --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossus_BouldersPoint = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 0.00 towards BossColossusFacingAngle degrees.)
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Neutral Beastmaster - Stampede BossColossus_BouldersPoint
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossusTempPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossus_BouldersPoint)
        Wait 10.00 seconds
        Unit - Remove Boulders (Colossus) from BossColossus
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Attack Once (Random unit from (Units in DragonFireSpam01 <gen> matching (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of Player 12 (Brown).) Equal to True)))
        Set VariableSet BossColossusBoulders = False
        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
